# Binary mesh files: never line-ending-normalize.  CRLF conversion
# corrupts binary STL/VTU/VTK/Exodus/CGNS/PLY/OFF/3MF payloads and would
# invalidate the sha256 pins in e2e/thingi10k/selection.json.
*.stl binary
*.vtu binary
*.vtk binary
*.exo binary
*.cgns binary
*.ply binary
*.off binary
*.3mf binary
*.nas binary
*.bdf binary
